From: LFRon <ronforever@outlook.com>
Date: 2026-10-13 15:02:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan/android: report COLOR_ATTACHMENT for framebuffer-usage external AHBs

ANGLE's AHardwareBuffer import requires COLOR_ATTACHMENT in formatFeatures
as soon as the buffer usage contains GPU_FRAMEBUFFER, but it does not chain
the external format resolve properties during that validation. Buffers such
as a decoder's GPU_SAMPLED_IMAGE|GPU_FRAMEBUFFER output were rejected with
EGL_BAD_PARAMETER, making eglCreateImageKHR fail every frame.

Report COLOR_ATTACHMENT on the public path for eight-bit external format
buffers whose usage allows framebuffer use. The resolve contract stays
enforced at image creation, and callers that chain the resolve properties
still get the same bit.

Signed-off-by: LFRon <ronforever@outlook.com>
---
diff --git a/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c b/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c
index e2575c96..e8baf8cd 100644
--- a/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c
+++ b/src/vulkan/runtime/vk_android.c
@@ -1186,6 +1186,13 @@ finish:
     */
    p->formatFeatures |= VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_2_MIDPOINT_CHROMA_SAMPLES_BIT_KHR;
 
+   if (p->format == VK_FORMAT_UNDEFINED &&
+       (desc.usage & AHARDWAREBUFFER_USAGE_GPU_FRAMEBUFFER) != 0 &&
+       device->physical->supported_extensions.ANDROID_external_format_resolve &&
+       vk_external_format_to_efr_format(external_format) ==
+          VK_FORMAT_R8G8B8A8_UNORM)
+      p->formatFeatures |= VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_2_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_BIT;
+
    return VK_SUCCESS;
 }
 
